# Recyclarr needs one API key per application. They are NOT kept here — the
# real .env travels over the TLS line into the host vault (D12) and never
# touches this repository.
#
# Read them out of each application own `config.xml` rather than the web
# interface — the same source the deploy checks and the busy check already
# use, and the only one that cannot go stale behind your back (F32):
#
#     grep -oP "(?<=<ApiKey>)[^<]+" /appdata/<stack>/radarr-config/config.xml
#     grep -oP "(?<=<ApiKey>)[^<]+" /appdata/<stack>/sonarr-config/config.xml
SONARR_API_KEY=
RADARR_API_KEY=
